  {
   "xml_index": 5,
   "xml_name": "L03_005_Sum Of Squares While",
   "display_name": "Sum Of Squares While",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Let's practice one more accumulator pattern: summing the <b>squares</b> of numbers, using arithmetic you already know (<code>i * i</code>) inside a <code>while</code> loop.</p>\n<pre>n = int(input())\ntotal = 0\ni = 1\nwhile i <= n:\n    total = total + (i * i)\n    i = i + 1\nprint(total)</pre>\n<p><b>Trace through:</b> if <code>n = 3</code>: <code>total</code> goes 0 -&gt; 1 (add 1*1) -&gt; 5 (add 2*2=4) -&gt; 14 (add 3*3=9). Final answer: <code>14</code>.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read a whole number <code>N</code>. Using a <code>while</code> loop and an accumulator, compute and print the sum of the squares of all whole numbers from 1 to <code>N</code> (inclusive).</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b> Input: <pre>3</pre> Output: <pre>14</pre></p>\n<p><b>Edge case:</b> Input: <pre>1</pre> Output: <pre>1</pre></p>",
