   "display_name": "Range With Big Jump Down",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Let's combine a negative step with a jump size bigger than 1, counting down by more than one at a time.</p>\n<pre>for i in range(20, 0, -5):\n    print(i)</pre>\n<p>This prints <code>20, 15, 10, 5</code> - starting at 20, subtracting 5 each time, and stopping as soon as the next value would be 0 or below.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read a whole number <code>N</code> (a multiple of 3). Using <code>range()</code> with a step of <code>-3</code>, print every multiple of 3 from <code>N</code> down to 3 (inclusive), one per line.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b> Input: <pre>15</pre> Output: <pre>15\n12\n9\n6\n3</pre></p>\n<p><b>Edge case (N is already 3 - just one number):</b> Input: <pre>3</pre> Output: <pre>3</pre></p>",
