   "questiontext_html": "<p>Let's revisit the sum-of-squares pattern, this time using a <code>for</code> loop instead of <code>while</code>.</p>\n<pre>n = int(input())\ntotal = 0\nfor i in range(1, n + 1):\n    total = total + (i * i)\nprint(total)</pre>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read a whole number <code>N</code>. Using a <code>for</code> loop and an accumulator, compute and print the sum of the squares of all whole numbers from 1 to <code>N</code> (inclusive).</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b> Input: <pre>3</pre> Output: <pre>14</pre></p>\n<p><b>Edge case:</b> Input: <pre>1</pre> Output: <pre>1</pre></p>",
