   "display_name": "Multiplication Table For",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Let's revisit the multiplication table from earlier labs, this time built with a <code>for</code> loop instead of <code>while</code>.</p>\n<pre>n = int(input())\nfor i in range(1, 11):\n    print(str(n) + \"x\" + str(i) + \"=\" + str(n * i))</pre>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read a whole number <code>n</code> and print its multiplication table from 1 to 10, in the exact format <code>n x i = result</code> (no spaces around <code>x</code> and <code>=</code>), one line per multiplication.</p>\n<p><b>Example (n=2):</b> Output: <pre>2x1=2\n2x2=4\n2x3=6\n2x4=8\n2x5=10\n2x6=12\n2x7=14\n2x8=16\n2x9=18\n2x10=20</pre></p>",
