   "xml_name": "L03_038_Count Elements Greater Than X",
   "display_name": "Count Elements Greater Than X",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Let's combine a loop-based counter with a comparison, instead of an exact match.</p>\n<pre>Lst = [11, 4, 18, 7, 25, 2, 14]\nx = int(input())\ncount = 0\nfor value in Lst:\n    if value > x:\n        count = count + 1\nprint(count)</pre>\n<p><b>Trace through:</b> if <code>x = 10</code>: elements greater than 10 are 11, 18, 25, 14 - that's 4 of them, so <code>count</code> ends at <code>4</code>.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Using the fixed list <code>Lst = [11, 4, 18, 7, 25, 2, 14]</code>, read a whole number <code>x</code> and print how many elements of the list are greater than <code>x</code>.</p>\n<p><b>Example 1:</b> Input: <pre>10</pre> Output: <pre>4</pre></p>\n<p><b>Example 2 (edge case - nothing qualifies):</b> Input: <pre>100</pre> Output: <pre>0</pre></p>",
